@CanadianPM 

Regarding the 28 October 2026 joint statement by Canada and the UAE on the three Iranian islands:

Your statement is a fabrication of historical reality and an unacceptable attempt to undermine Iran’s territorial integrity. Recognising such a claim is no different from Iran endorsing America’s claim to ownership of Canada.
The Iranian people will not forget this affront or those who chose to make it.

@CanadaFP 
@MarkJCarney 
@AnitaAnandMP

